      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Impaza treatment of erectile dysfunction in patients with essential hypertension and CHD receiving cardiotropic therapy improved erectile function and increased reserve circulation. Addition of impaza to the treatment protocol in cardiological patients considerably increased perfusion and reduced the content of desquamated epitheliocytes. No side effects of impaza were noted."},
